      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Leiomyosarcoma arising from the ovarian vein is extremely rare: only one case was found in the literature. We report a case in a sixty-one-year-old woman who had unexplained attacks of pain in her left lower abdomen and flank for two years."},
